{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# Companion twist: does $\\langle x|$ diagonalise $B$ for general gl(3) reps? (L=1)\n\nGeneralises `Companion-B-C-diagonalize.wb` (adjoint) to $\\Lambda=\\{\\lambda_1,\\lambda_2,0\\}$. Left states\n$\\langle x_{\\mu}| = \\langle\\text{vac}|\\,\\mathbb{T}_{\\mu_{11}\\text{-ish},0}(\\theta_1)\\,\\mathbb{T}_{\\text{den},0}(\\theta_1)^{-1}\\,\\mathbb{T}_{\\mu_{21},\\mu_{12}}(\\theta_1)$ with fused $\\mathbb{T}_\\lambda$ from CBR; vacuum = lowest-weight GT pattern $\\{\\Lambda,\\{\\lambda_2,0\\},\\{0\\}\\}$. Everything numeric ($h,\\theta_1,\\chi$, and $u$) so dim-27 reps stay fast.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ps[rep_] :=\n  ps[rep] = \n   Block[{res = (Prepend[rep, #] & /@ (Tuples[\n          Table[Range[rep[[1, i + 1]], rep[[1, i]]], {i, 1, \n            Length[rep[[1]]] - 1}]]))}, \n    If[Length[res[[1, 1]]] == 1, Reverse@Sort@res, \n     Reverse@Sort@Flatten[ps /@ res, 1]]];\ndim[rep_] := dim[rep] = Length[ps[{rep}]];\nJ0[k_][pat_] := \n  J0[k][pat] = \n   Sum[pat[[k, i]], {i, 1, k}] - Sum[pat[[k - 1, i]], {i, 1, k - 1}];\nJp[k_][pat_] := \n  Jp[k][pat] = -Sum[\n     Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k + 1, j]] + j, {j, \n         Range[k + 1]}]/\n       Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, \n         Complement[Range[k], {i}]}] v[\n       ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] + 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJm[k_][pat_] := \n  Jm[k][pat] = \n   Sum[Product[\n       pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k - 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k - 1]}]/\n      Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, \n        Complement[Range[k], {i}]}] v[\n      ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] - 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJJ[k_, l_, rep_] := \n  JJ[k, l, rep] = \n   Which[k == l, DiagonalMatrix[J0[k] /@ ps[{rep}]], l == k + 1, \n    Transpose[\n     Table[Coefficient[Jp[k][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#]] & /@ \n       ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]], l == k - 1, \n    Transpose[\n     Table[Coefficient[Jm[l][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#]] & /@ \n       ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]], l > k + 1, \n    JJ[k, k + 1, rep] . JJ[k + 1, l, rep] - \n     JJ[k + 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k + 1, rep], l < k - 1, \n    JJ[k, k - 1, rep] . JJ[k - 1, l, rep] - \n     JJ[k - 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k - 1, rep]];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* same Lax / twist / quantum minors / B as the adjoint notebook, but reading the rep from the global rep0 so we can loop over reps *)\nClearAll[Lax, T, TG, QM, QMG, tG, tA, tCBR, conjP, B];\nG = {{\\[Chi][1], \\[Chi][2], \\[Chi][3]}, {1, 0, 0}, {0, 1, 0}};\nLax[i_, j_][u_] := u IdentityMatrix[dim[rep0]] KroneckerDelta[i, j] - h JJ[j, i, rep0];\nT[{i_, j_}][u_] := T[{i, j}][u] = Lax[i, j][u - \\[Theta][1]];\nTG[{i_, j_}][u_] := TG[{i, j}][u] = Sum[Lax[i, k][u - \\[Theta][1]] G[[k, j]], {k, 3}];\nQM[Ii_, Jj_][u_] := QM[Ii, Jj][u] = Sum[Signature[Permutations[Ii][[\\[Sigma]]]] (Dot @@ (T[#][u + h - h Position[Transpose[{Permutations[Ii][[\\[Sigma]]], Jj}], #] // Flatten // Last] & /@ Transpose[{Permutations[Ii][[\\[Sigma]]], Jj}])), {\\[Sigma], 1, Length[Permutations[Ii]]}];\nQMG[Ii_, Jj_][u_] := QMG[Ii, Jj][u] = Sum[Signature[Permutations[Ii][[\\[Sigma]]]] (Dot @@ (TG[#][u + h - h Position[Transpose[{Permutations[Ii][[\\[Sigma]]], Jj}], #] // Flatten // Last] & /@ Transpose[{Permutations[Ii][[\\[Sigma]]], Jj}])), {\\[Sigma], 1, Length[Permutations[Ii]]}];\ntG[a_][u_] := tG[a][u] = Sum[QMG[Ii, Ii][u], {Ii, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];\nB[u_] := T[{1, 1}][u] . QM[{1, 2}, {1, 2}][u + h] + T[{2, 1}][u] . QM[{1, 2}, {1, 3}][u + h];\n(* CBR: T_lam(u) = det T_{lam'_j+i-j,1}(u+h(i-1)) *)\ntA[a_][u_] := Which[a == 0, IdentityMatrix[dim[rep0]], a < 0 || a > 3, ConstantArray[0, {1, 1} dim[rep0]], True, tG[a][u]];\nconjP[lam_] := Table[Count[lam, x_ /; x >= j], {j, 1, Max[lam, 0]}];\ntCBR[lam_][u_] := tCBR[lam][u] = With[{l1 = Max[lam, 0], lp = conjP[lam]}, If[l1 == 0, tA[0][u], Sum[Signature[p] (Dot @@ Table[tA[lp[[p[[i]]]] + i - p[[i]]][u + h (i - 1)], {i, l1}]), {p, Permutations[Range[l1]]}]]];\n(* memo entries are keyed by u only, so wipe them (keep the pattern rules) when rep0 changes *)\nclearMemo[f_] := (DownValues[f] = Select[DownValues[f], ! FreeQ[#[[1]], Pattern] &]; SubValues[f] = Select[SubValues[f], ! FreeQ[#[[1]], Pattern] &]);\nsetRep[rep_] := (rep0 = rep; clearMemo /@ {T, TG, QM, QMG, tG, tCBR};);",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* numeric parameters: generic rationals *)\nh = 2/5; \\[Theta][1] = 1/3; \\[Chi][1] = 5/11; \\[Chi][2] = -2/7; \\[Chi][3] = 3/13;\n(* labels {{mu11},{mu21,mu12}} for rep {l1,l2,0}; vacuum = lowest weight {{0},{l2,0},rep} in ps ordering *)\ngtLabels[rep_] := Flatten[Table[{{m11}, {m21, m12}}, {m11, rep[[2]], rep[[1]]}, {m12, rep[[3]], rep[[2]]}, {m21, m12, m11}], 2];\nvacLof[rep_] := {UnitVector[dim[rep], First@FirstPosition[ps[{rep}], {{0}, {rep[[2]], 0}, rep}]]};\n(* three candidate numerators/denominators for the mu11 factor (they coincide when l2 = 1) *)\nratio[\"a\", rep_, m11_] := {m11, rep[[2]]};\nratio[\"b\", rep_, m11_] := {m11 - rep[[2]] + 1, 1};\nratio[\"c\", rep_, m11_] := {m11, 1};\nxState[var_, rep_][{{m11_}, {m21_, m12_}}] := With[{nd = ratio[var, rep, m11]}, vacLof[rep] . tCBR[{nd[[1]], 0}][\\[Theta][1]] . Inverse[tCBR[{nd[[2]], 0}][\\[Theta][1]]] . tCBR[{m21, m12}][\\[Theta][1]]];\n(* per rep and variant: #labels vs dim, # states that are left eigenvectors of B at two u values, rank of the whole set *)\ntestRep[rep_] := (setRep[rep]; Table[With[{xs = xState[var, rep] /@ gtLabels[rep]}, {rep, var, Length[gtLabels[rep]] == dim[rep], Count[Table[MatrixRank[Join[xx, xx . B[uu]]], {xx, xs}, {uu, {3/7, -5/3}}], {1, 1}], MatrixRank[Join @@ xs]}], {var, {\"a\", \"b\", \"c\"}}]);",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* columns: rep, variant, #labels==dim, #states that are B-eigenvectors (both u), rank of all states; want #eig = rank = dim *)\nres = Join @@ (testRep /@ {{2, 1, 0}, {3, 1, 0}, {3, 2, 0}, {4, 2, 0}});\nGrid[Prepend[Append[#, dim[#[[1]]]] & /@ res, {\"rep\", \"variant\", \"labels==dim\", \"#eigvecs\", \"rank\", \"dim\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"790499\" data-output-id=\"70\" data-out-n=\"479\" data-sub-idx=\"2\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"4\" data-sub-start=\"2\" data-sub-end=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[479]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:15.64em;vertical-align:-7.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:8.09em;\"><span style=\"top:-10.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:10.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:15.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-7.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:8.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-10.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rep</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:0.59em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:1.79em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:2.99em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:4.19em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:7.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:15.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-7.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:8.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-10.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">variant</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">a</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">b</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">c</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">a</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">b</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">c</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mo